; ==============================================================================
;  LiteStep Enhanced - 简体中文: the pixel font has no CJK glyphs and is made for size 8
;  without smoothing. Text uses Microsoft YaHei UI, larger and smoothed; the clock
;  keeps the pixel font (MMClockFont).
; ==============================================================================
MMFont "Microsoft YaHei UI"
MMFontSmall "Microsoft YaHei UI"
MMFontSize 11
MMTextAA GrayScale
